		"name": "Harold Mercer",
		"who": "Halcyon's founder, 70s. Fired in 1994 for fighting WARDEN.",
		"voice": "Gravelly, wry, unhurried. An old engineer talking into a cassette recorder at his desk on his last day. Amused more than angry.",
	},
